From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 08:59:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Publish validated V2 block transitions atomically in LevelDB

Bind validation to the stored parent header, monetary record and root. Publish exact block bytes, child header, monetary state and staged coins/tree in one synchronous batch. Reuse complete-block fixtures to check database reopen, durable disconnect and reconnect against the in-memory oracle with a tiny cache. This remains a module integration, not lotusd ConnectTip or a launched network.
